 // tile_add and tile_delete keep an up-to-date index current instead of marking it stale, so the next lookup needs no
 // rebuild: crumbling sand in rm_a3h04 alternates tile_exists and tile_delete, and rebuilt ~3,000 entries each time.
 static bool tileIndexCurrent(Room* room) {
